entityDescription:
EVERYTHINK is an award-winning studio for creativity, design, and innovation, established in 2008 in Porto. Through design, they put creative methodologies, strategic thinking mechanical engineering, and prototyping together at the service of companies&rsquo; innovation, to create new services, products, and experiences. The team works on different areas and for different outputs, offering diversity and experience in an cross-pollination effect, offering innovative insights, efficiency, and time-to-market. 
We have a very broad portfolio of projects developed in different sectors (aircrafts, autonomous platforms, mobility, medtech, ...) and involving different disciplines necessary to create new products and services: 
&bull; Creative tools to align teams, organizations, and user/customers insights, generate ideas, and build value propositions; 
&bull; Conceptualization and design of products and services, industrial design, rendering;
&bull; Mechanical engineering, simulation;
&bull; Design for manufacturing, supporting materialization, and industrialization;
&bull; Prototyping, including an in-house prototyping laboratory.
